# RepoLens

AI-powered GitHub repository intelligence tool. See the project specification for full documentation.

## Quick start (Phase 1)

```bash
pip install -e .
repolens --help
repolens analyze --help
```

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and configure as needed.

## Status

Implementation follows the phased plan in the specification. Phase 1 (foundation) is complete.
